    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1607aafd2d9b4328bb9b1920f0b505f3",
      "statement": "Four environments exist: Sandbox (synthetic data, no SLA), Certification (masked data), Production (SLAs apply) and an Internal host reachable only on the private network that serves the restricted risk and finance APIs API-10, API-14, API-15 and API-16.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/mhfc-developer-platform-api-reference.md#L20-L27",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:27ff4438d8bffafe65e842234d46b6739bdecb6078d09803ba1623001c959681:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_149a8984d896416bb3a9d4bfdb00e6b7",
      "statement": "All APIs use OAuth 2.0: client-credentials with mutual TLS (certificate-bound tokens) for server-to-server clients, authorization-code with PKCE and customer consent for customer-facing integrations, 15-minute JWT access tokens, and enforced least-privilege per-API scopes.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/mhfc-developer-platform-api-reference.md#L29-L37",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1d7be9097ac71884e5135b73fdf95685ad9bd5eac5981bc6da3f1401b63bc1b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_34232a45cd304b2ea22b9f878e59c344",
      "statement": "Versioning puts the major version in the path, keeps minor versions additive and backward compatible, supports a major version for at least 12 months after its successor reaches GA, and announces deprecation through the Sunset header and developer portal.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/mhfc-developer-platform-api-reference.md#L39-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:13d46050fb6797359b40b381ea95cf5c395b1d96b7226c5a8cfd4d0aca8bcfa3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c3833efd07b745d1900bea3ef8884829",
      "statement": "Rate limits are per client and per API with X-RateLimit headers and Retry-After on 429; money-moving or resource-creating POSTs require an Idempotency-Key retained for 24 hours; lists use cursor pagination; timestamps are ISO 8601 UTC and risk/finance payloads state units.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/mhfc-developer-platform-api-reference.md#L43-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:85e8e23ec53d22aa289fd530f0124b361c2e1fd66290c3f832fb5cf3b2664ae2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_53dea499f23b4a9a90fd1ea0351aee90",
      "statement": "Errors use a common envelope with code, message and requestId, with defined codes for 400, 401, 403, 404, 409 (idempotency-key reuse with different payload or state conflict), 429, 500 (safe to retry idempotent requests with backoff) and 503.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/mhfc-developer-platform-api-reference.md#L50-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f9a7e7a5c27ef370d4084f03091779f6807b6f2044c43499b005b5a58cea78c2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_36016126077a4bec80edb046f7086457",
      "statement": "APIs feeding Tier 1 models or regulatory disclosures are BCBS 239 critical data services with named data owners, data-quality rules, enhanced change management and model-inventory registration, so any breaking change automatically triggers an MRGR model change review.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sources/api_docs/mhfc-developer-platform-api-reference.md#L18-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1911fe2b741a3143411f7afb253d43080ad46591d44c2882658a55dbd0bc0329:"
