      "statement": "The catalog assigns each API an ID, version, domain and owning team; Digital Platforms Engineering owns API-01, 02 and 17, Global Payments Technology owns API-03 to 05, Market Data Services owns API-12 and 13, Risk Analytics Engineering owns API-10 and 14, and Developer Platform Engineering owns API-18.",
