      "id": "claim_c9384deec958440bab77dacdd48be2c3",
      "statement": "Per-API rate limits and SLOs differ by purpose: Fraud Risk Signals is sized at 50,000 requests/second with p99 60 ms for internal callers, while risk and finance APIs are low-volume (API-10 60/min, API-14 30/min, API-16 20/min) with freshness objectives such as quarterly refresh within T+3, publication within 1 business day of approval, and quarter-end lock by day 25.",
